     The SNMPv3 message digests, encryption and decryption, and key routines
     use the cryptographic functions from crypto(3).  The library may option‐
     ally be built without references to the crypto(3) library. In such case
     only plain text SNMPv3 PDUs without message digests may be proccessed
     correctly.

